| Backend API host | Azure App Service | Linux, Python 3.11; hosts the stateless FastAPI application over HTTP |
| API framework | Python + FastAPI | Stateless REST API; hosting-agnostic core logic |
| Data platform | Azure PostgreSQL Flexible Server | Single source of truth for all planning, actuals, and reference data |
